---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description={siteConfig.description} bodyClass="about-page">
  <section class="about-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">About the author</p><h1>杨雨飞<span> / YYF</span></h1><p class="about-lede">信息安全专业学生，持续学习如何把复杂的技术问题讲清楚、做可靠。</p></div><img class="about-avatar" src="/github-avatar.png" alt="杨雨飞的 GitHub 头像" width="96" height="96" /></section>
  <section class="about-grid" aria-label="个人信息">
    <article class="about-panel"><p class="panel-label">Who I am / Background</p><h2>{siteConfig.education}</h2><p>关注软件系统的边界、实现与长期维护，也关心安全视角下的工程取舍。</p></article>
    <article class="about-panel"><p class="panel-label">Research interests</p><ul class="about-interest-list">{siteConfig.interests.map((interest) => <li>{interest}</li>)}</ul></article>
    <article class="about-panel"><p class="panel-label">What I write about</p><h2>从论文到具体问题。</h2><p>论文阅读与模型理解：NLP、多模态、计算机视觉和 LLM 表格处理。算法练习：ACM / OJ 输入输出、状态压缩与动态规划。</p><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Browse the notebook →</a></article>
    <article class="about-panel"><p class="panel-label">Current focus</p><h2>记录输入，也检验理解。</h2><p>近期笔记围绕论文阅读和算法练习展开。这里保存那些需要反复推敲的技术问题，便于以后回看。</p></article>
    <article class="about-panel about-links"><p class="panel-label">Code & links</p><p>代码与项目记录在 GitHub，学习笔记保存在这里。</p><a class="text-link" href={siteConfig.github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub / duolaBmeng673 ↗</a></article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
